</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib32.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2410.14157</span>.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib33" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">(33)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Ye, J., Xie, Z., Zheng, L., Gao, J., Wu, Z., Jiang, X., Li, Z., and Kong, L. (2025b).

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Dream 7b: Diffusion large language models.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib33.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2508.15487</span>.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib34" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zheng et al.,  (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zheng, L., Chiang, W.-L., Sheng, Y., Zhuang, S., Wu, Z., Zhuang, Y., Lin, Z., Li, Z., Li, D., Xing, E., et al. (2023).

</span>
